		<div class="alert alert-info">
			<p>
				A widget is a basic app that lets you add simple HTML and Javascript to pre-defined locations in
				the agent interface.
			</p>
			<p>
				Full apps are capable of doing much more than this. If you want more information about how to build
				and package apps, refer to the <a href="https://manuals.deskpro.com/html/developer-apps/" target="_blank">Deskpro App Development Manual</a>.
			</p>
		</div>

